# Orca — agent routing (Cursor vs Codex)

When spawning Orca workers (`worker-start --agent …`), pick the agent by **task kind**:

| Task kind | `--agent` | Notes |
| --------- | --------- | ----- |
| Implementation / coding / fix / migrate / tests that write code | `cursor` | Default for all ownership slices (BE / web / iOS / coordinator code) |
| Plan, design, spike write-up, architecture choice, design critique | `codex` | Prefer Codex; Cursor fallback on quota/launch failure |
| Plan/design when Codex unavailable | `cursor` | Fallback only |
| DoD / acceptance review of implementation (Issue → `Chờ duyệt`) | `codex` | Spawn one Codex reviewer ≠ implementer; **no user approval gate** |
| Security-sensitive review (RLS/authz/races) | `codex` | Independent of implementer; may be separate from DoD; exact-SHA evidence |
| Epic orchestrator (parent Issue đợt/module) | `cursor` | One orchestrator per Epic — see `orca-epic-orchestrator.mdc` |

## Sau DoD PASS — coordinator phải duyệt (không chờ user)

Khi reviewer **PASS** / **PASS with known gap** + CI xanh trên exact SHA:

1. Merge PR vào `main` (coordinator).
2. Cập nhật Project #3 Status → **Hoàn thành** (+ comment evidence SHA).
3. Đóng Issue nếu đó là đơn vị DoD.
4. **Không** để item treo `Chờ duyệt` chờ user bấm duyệt.

FAIL → giữ `Chờ duyệt` hoặc trả `Đang làm`; comment findings; re-dispatch coding worker.

## DoD / security review — bắt buộc trong spec

1. Issue # / PR # / paths  
2. **Exact commit SHA(s)** đang duyệt  
3. Checklist DoD hoặc security  
4. Báo cáo: reviewer/session, checks, findings/limitations, verdict PASS|FAIL|PASS with known gap  
5. SHA hành vi mới sau review → revalidation; cấm tái dùng verdict  

**Thiếu GitHub PR review UI ≠ thiếu Orca DoD.** Artifact Issue/PR/`docs/reviews/*` + exact SHA là đủ để coordinator duyệt.

## Fallback (Codex quota / launch failure)

If `worker-start --agent codex` fails (quota, auth, launch error) or the worker reports quota exhaustion:

1. Retry the **same Task** with `--agent cursor` (same `--spec` / `--task`, same scope).
2. Note in the coordinator report: Codex unavailable → Cursor fallback for plan/DoD.
3. Do **not** switch coding workers from Cursor to Codex to “save” Cursor quota.

## Examples

```text
✅ Coding: --agent cursor
✅ DoD on Chờ duyệt: --agent codex → PASS → coordinator merge + Hoàn thành
✅ Codex quota → retry DoD with --agent cursor
❌ Leave Chờ duyệt after PASS waiting for user
❌ Coding worker with --agent codex
❌ DoD pass without exact SHA / without independent session
```

## Overrides

- User explicitly names an agent/model → honor that for that Task.
- Still respect ownership scopes, parallel-first coding, and WIP backpressure.
